@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Critical-pair generation and exact finite joinability
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Outer rule + non-variable\nLHS position p" as OUTER #DBE4FF
component "Renamed-apart inner rule" as INNER #DBE4FF
component "Iterative unifier + occurs check\n<latex>\sigma = \operatorname{mgu}(l_1|_p,l_2)</latex>" as UNIFY #FFF3BF
component "Shared variable normalizer" as SHARED #FFE8CC
component "Outer reduct\n<latex>\sigma(r_1)</latex>" as LEFT #C3FAE8
component "Inner reduct\n<latex>\sigma(l_1[r_2]_p)</latex>" as RIGHT #E5DBFF
queue "Left BFS frontier" as LQ #C3FAE8
queue "Right BFS frontier" as RQ #E5DBFF
component "Canonical structural-key\nintersection" as MEET #FFF3BF
component "Joinable" as JOIN #D3F9D8
component "Both frontiers\nempty (AND)" as EXHAUST #FFF3BF
component "Proven non-joinable\nboth finite frontiers exhausted" as CONFLICT #FCC2D7
component "Incomplete\ncap or non-left-linear rule" as UNKNOWN #FFE3E3

OUTER --> UNIFY
INNER --> UNIFY
UNIFY --> SHARED
SHARED --> LEFT
SHARED --> RIGHT
LEFT --> LQ
RIGHT --> RQ
LQ --> MEET : explicit rewrite successors
RQ --> MEET : explicit rewrite successors
MEET --> JOIN : common key
LQ --> EXHAUST : empty
RQ --> EXHAUST : empty
EXHAUST --> CONFLICT : exact exhaustion
UNIFY --> UNKNOWN : step cap
LQ --> UNKNOWN : state/term cap
RQ --> UNKNOWN : state/term cap

note bottom of SHARED #F1F3F5
Both branches and every successor preserve the same
symbolic variable identities; independent alpha-renaming
would unsoundly collapse pair(x,y) with pair(y,x).
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF> | normalized overlap inputs |
|<#FFF3BF> | exact unification/comparison decision |
|<#FFE8CC> | cross-branch identity invariant |
|<#C3FAE8> | outer rewrite branch |
|<#E5DBFF> | inner rewrite branch |
|<#D3F9D8> | common reduct found |
|<#FCC2D7> | exact finite conflict evidence |
|<#FFE3E3> | qualified incomplete outcome |
endlegend
@enduml
